.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, r2SCAN-3c, charge +1, optimisation and frequencies of the protomer with the proton on the amino nitrogen (conformer 4 of the CREST step). This calculation shows the other nitrogen: protonating it takes the lone pair out of the resonance with the ring, and the energy is 159.6 kJ/mol above the ring-N protomer (computed electronic energies, no zero-point correction).
